(6163558, 909319, 96751, '<td valign="top">That''s a lot of tp...!  Beautifully assembled.  Looks like a real dress.  Also beautifully lit, if just a teensy bit hot on her neck</td>', 'That''s a lot of tp...!  Beautifully assembled.  Looks like a real dress.  Also beautifully lit, if just a teensy bit hot on her neck', '2010-09-15 23:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6163559, 909192, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something so cool about this shot.  I''m a sucker for motion blur, but also the tonal range is terrific, and the ephemeral quality of the animal and paper with the solidity and clarity of the knobs and string are very appealing, although I''d have cropped out the top part with the crack.  Love it.</td>', 'There is something so cool about this shot.  I''m a sucker for motion blur, but also the tonal range is terrific, and the ephemeral quality of the animal and paper with the solidity and clarity of the knobs and string are very appealing, although I''d have cropped out the top part with the crack.  Love it.', '2010-09-15 23:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
