(6164314, 909530, 40391, '<td valign="top">Come back to comment.<br/> <br/>This was my pick for the challenge.  A professionally achieved shot (colour, composition etc) with plenty happening to keep the viewers attention.  It''s good to see you remembered the basic rules and did not clone out the wires.  For me this shows how much setting up was required.  With such a great set up I would have liked to had seen a little more light casted onto the hanging chair.  Well done - this got a 9 from me.</td>', 'Come back to comment. This was my pick for the challenge.  A professionally achieved shot (colour, composition etc) with plenty happening to keep the viewers attention.  It''s good to see you remembered the basic rules and did not clone out the wires.  For me this shows how much setting up was required.  With such a great set up I would have liked to had seen a little more light casted onto the hanging chair.  Well done - this got a 9 from me.', '2010-09-16 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
