(6168902, 909498, 120171, '<td valign="top">Well done on your top ten, I thought my Blue Peter effort was getting creative but clearly your art grades at school were A''s. Two great results in a week.</td>', 'Well done on your top ten, I thought my Blue Peter effort was getting creative but clearly your art grades at school were A''s. Two great results in a week.', '2010-09-22 02:13:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168904, 909530, 114969, '<td valign="top">Thank you all! Very glad about this result :-)<br/> <br/>@<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=93565" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">spiritualspatula</a>: In fact some of the threads transit in front of objects, so black wouldn''t work well everywhere. Ideally, I should have painted them black when in front of nothing, and white/pink in front of objects, but it was hard to do so since locations depend on lens'' angle... A bit lazy I guess.</td>', 'Thank you all! Very glad about this result :-) @ spiritualspatula: In fact some of the threads transit in front of objects, so black wouldn''t work well everywhere. Ideally, I should have painted them black when in front of nothing, and white/pink in front of objects, but it was hard to do so since locations depend on lens'' angle... A bit lazy I guess.', '2010-09-22 02:13:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168912, 909530, 96751, '<td valign="top">This was so clearly the winner.  Fabulous capture.<br/> <br/>You can stop hogging the ribbons now.</td>', 'This was so clearly the winner.  Fabulous capture. You can stop hogging the ribbons now.', '2010-09-22 02:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168914, 908855, 66515, '<td valign="top">Well...I had to read a few comments to get the connection. Calling it "Toilette Pepper" may have helped your cause. In any event good try and its good to see someone thinking outside of the box.</td>', 'Well...I had to read a few comments to get the connection. Calling it "Toilette Pepper" may have helped your cause. In any event good try and its good to see someone thinking outside of the box.', '2010-09-22 02:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168919, 909530, 96530, '<td valign="top">Ha ha, well done Christophe! And your model did a very nice job for you too :)</td>', 'Ha ha, well done Christophe! And your model did a very nice job for you too :)', '2010-09-22 02:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168920, 909319, 112218, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all those who made positive and helpful comments.<br/> <br/>This was a family effort.<br/>Materials used - 2 stools, ball, hoop, sticky tape, and toilet paper.<br/>Hoop to hold bottom of "skirt" edge, band for waist with strips of tape running down between them and toilet paper wound round and round....and round...etc.<br/> <br/>Still getting my eye in with the focus - a point raised by many, but getting there!<br/>A new PB!!!</td>', 'Thank you to all those who made positive and helpful comments. This was a family effort.Materials used - 2 stools, ball, hoop, sticky tape, and toilet paper.Hoop to hold bottom of "skirt" edge, band for waist with strips of tape running down between them and toilet paper wound round and round....and round...etc. Still getting my eye in with the focus - a point raised by many, but getting there!A new PB!!!', '2010-09-22 02:31:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168942, 909530, 105130, '<td valign="top">Congrats Christophe, I had a pretty good idea this was you because of the complexity of the setup. Coming second to this image is an honour. :-)</td>', 'Congrats Christophe, I had a pretty good idea this was you because of the complexity of the setup. Coming second to this image is an honour. :-)', '2010-09-22 02:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168952, 908531, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations! This was my favourite shot out of this challenge.</td>', 'Congratulations! This was my favourite shot out of this challenge.', '2010-09-22 03:06:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168955, 908432, 30982, '<td valign="top">Shots with toys rarely do well - never have quite figured that one, but that seems to be one of those golden rules.  Somewhere is that huge list of things to do and not do on DPC, and I think toys is on the don''t do list.  On my often too bright monitor, there is no detail in the package of Charmin - or maybe I''m just assuming it is a package of Charmin.  On my monitor it appears to be a sign floating in air.  Of course, that could indeed be what it is.  And overall, the shot really needs an amphibian of some sort.  :-)  Not a sub-5 shot, though.</td>', 'Shots with toys rarely do well - never have quite figured that one, but that seems to be one of those golden rules.  Somewhere is that huge list of things to do and not do on DPC, and I think toys is on the don''t do list.  On my often too bright monitor, there is no detail in the package of Charmin - or maybe I''m just assuming it is a package of Charmin.  On my monitor it appears to be a sign floating in air.  Of course, that could indeed be what it is.  And overall, the shot really needs an amphibian of some sort.  :-)  Not a sub-5 shot, though.', '2010-09-22 03:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6168962, 909674, 112798, '<td valign="top">There is something about this design that draws me to it.  I doodle this pretty often, and seeing your artistry with it is incredibly powerful.  Had I remembered to vote in time, I would have given it a 10.</td>', 'There is something about this design that draws me to it.  I doodle this pretty often, and seeing your artistry with it is incredibly powerful.  Had I remembered to vote in time, I would have given it a 10.', '2010-09-22 03:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
